note S5 scrub inside an inline function written before a global. pinshut is set when the body pass begins
note any fn, an inline one too, so the global takes no pin and its reads use MOVZ/MOVK; under omc 0d7f2f42
note (no pinshut) the inline body, compiled at its call site after the global, restored the pin. Exit 0.
om2
fn clean to ulong inline
k = scrub 64
ret ulong k
end
global g ulong 5000
fn main to int
j = ulong 4999
put g j 5
k = clean
y = get g j
if ne y 5
ret 2
end
ret int k
end
